# The SQL Server image the sample's tests and its load test run (DAT-005, ADR-0098): SQL Server 2025, the engine
# closest to Azure SQL Database's, pinned by tag and digest so Docker checks what it pulls. Dependabot moves it
# (.github/dependabot.yml). Its Developer edition is licensed for development and testing only, and the tests accept
# its EULA. Nothing builds this file; it only names the image, in one place.
